{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04734","headline":"扈从幸韦嗣立山庄应制 · 张说","name":"扈从幸韦嗣立山庄应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒灰飞玉琯，汤井驻金舆。\n既得方明相，还寻大隗居。\n悬泉珠贯下，列帐锦屏舒。\n骑远林逾密，笳繁谷自虚。\n门旗堑复磴，殿幕裹通渠。\n舞凤迎公主，雕龙赋婕妤。\n地幽天赏洽，酒乐御筵初。\n菲才叨侍从，连藻媿应徐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04734.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04734","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}